# Project pages

Copy a template folder to `projects/<slug>/`. Do not copy Bora, Tangley, or any other live project.

- Identity, logo, and other non-type work: `templates/project/`
- Type design: `templates/type/`

Each live page names its template in the first HTML comment. Keep that comment.

## Non-type intro credits

`templates/project/` intro meta always includes all four fields, in this order:

1. Year
2. Client
3. Art-direction
4. Deliverables

Match the template markup (`Art&#8209;direction` non-breaking hyphen). Ask for any unknown values instead of omitting a field.

Type pages from `templates/type/` skip this credit list.

## Images

On project pages, only hero SVGs follow `--ink` when the theme changes. Story and other project images keep their original colours. To skip theming on a hero SVG, add `data-keep-color` to the `img` or a parent.
